# Carries example URLs, including one asserted to be REFUSED. The addresses are
# reserved-for-documentation names that resolve nowhere, so they add nobody to
# the list of hosts this wallet can reach — but a URL in a test is still a URL
# somebody could quietly turn into a real one, and the fixture that proves plain
# HTTP is rejected is exactly the line worth noticing if it changes.
